Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.13,0:24:55.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.70,0:24:56.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,There's so many of them !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:58.74,def2,SAIJO,0,0,0,,Total 15,000 and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:00.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That shape… Could that be…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:01.90,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Supernova ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.16,0:25:05.72,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I just want to do what’s normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.72,0:25:08.36,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai, fire the wave motion gun !
